xnu 0303: the panel follows the power key and the finger

0302 blanked the panel three seconds after the compositor went quiet, so the
lock screen stayed lit after the press. Blank on the power key itself: the
tick paints black on the next refresh, and the lock animation's frames are
dropped for 1.2 s (measured: the animation runs about half a second) so they
cannot light the panel again. A press while the panel is black is the wake,
and so is a touch; the first frame after either is shown at once, while a
frame with no input behind it still needs the three-present burst. The
fallback timeout drops to one second; a touch or a wake gets a five-second
grace before the timer can blank a still lock screen or a launching app.
mondrianfb_blank=0 still disables the timer.

